FL,320,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786448897
OL,3,CFerrari worth #3.7m among cars seized
OL,4,Cin London police crackdown
OL,6,FThe Metropolitan Police said 90
OL,7,Fvehicles worth more than #8 million
OL,8,Fwere impounded during the operation,
OL,9,Fwhich also focused on uninsured
OL,10,Fdriving by "reckless boy racers".
OL,12,FThe convertible Ferrari Monza SP2 `
OL,13,Fone of only 499 made by the Italian
OL,14,Fcompany ` had only been in the UK for
OL,15,Fa day, having been imported from Saudi
OL,16,FArabia.
OL,18,FPolice said the driver, who was
OL,19,Fstopped at a supercar gathering in
OL,20,FMayfair, only had a provisional
OL,21,Fdriving licence and no insurance.
OL,26,@rD@LOUrD@`O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/12
