OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786448897
OL,3,CFerrari worth #3.7m among cars seized
OL,4,Cin London police crackdown
OL,6,FOne Met officer became an internet
OL,7,Fsensation after donning sunglasses to
OL,8,Fsteer the open-top through the streets
OL,9,Fof central London back to the force's
OL,10,Fpound, as stunned onlookers took his
OL,11,Fpicture.
OL,13,FWatch as Met Police officer in
OL,14,Fsunglasses drives seized Ferrari Monza
OL,15,FSP2 through streets of London to pound:
OL,17,FCredit: @tomspotz
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
