OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786448897
OL,3,CFerrari worth #3.7m among cars seized
OL,4,Cin London police crackdown
OL,6,FVideo footage showed a police escort
OL,7,Fwith flashing blue lights accompanying
OL,8,Fthe officer, with one viewer
OL,9,Fsuggesting on social media that he'd
OL,10,Fwon the drive by beating colleagues in
OL,11,Fa game, adding: "Rock paper scissors
OL,12,Fwho gets to drive it."
OL,14,FOne of the limited edition 6.5-litre,
OL,15,F810bhp Ferraris sold at auction for
OL,16,Falmost five million dollars
OL,17,F(#3.7million) earlier this year.
OL,26,@sD@QOUtD@VO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786448897
OL,3,CFerrari worth #3.7m among cars seized
OL,4,Cin London police crackdown
OL,6,FFifteen vehicles were seized under new
OL,7,Fpowers allowing police to seize them
OL,8,Frather than give a warning if they are
OL,9,Finvolved in anti-social behaviour.
OL,11,FSpecial Chief Inspector Geoff Tatman,
OL,12,Fwho led the operation, said: "We
OL,13,Fregularly hear from local people who
OL,14,Fare fed up with people driving cars
OL,15,Fdangerously in the area, or with
OL,16,Fmodifications which make them a
OL,17,Fnuisance to those who live nearby.
OL,26,@tD@^OU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786448897
OL,3,CFerrari worth #3.7m among cars seized
OL,4,Cin London police crackdown
OL,6,F"Through operations like this we're
OL,7,Farresting these drivers and seizing
OL,8,Ftheir cars so we can keep our roads
OL,9,Fsafe and send clear message that we
OL,10,Fwon't put up with their reckless and
OL,11,Fdangerous behaviour."
OL,13,FVehicle stops also saw a man arrested
OL,14,Fon suspicion of handling stolen goods
OL,15,Fand money laundering, after he was
OL,16,Ffound with 19 bank cards in other
OL,17,Fpeople's names and more than #2,500 in
OL,18,Fcash.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@UO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31907
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786448897
OL,3,CFerrari worth #3.7m among cars seized
OL,4,Cin London police crackdown
OL,6,FAnother male stopped for driving
OL,7,Fwithout insurance was arrested on
OL,8,Fsuspicion of possession with intent to
OL,9,Fsupply drugs with one further arrest
OL,10,Ffor using words and behaviour that
OL,11,Fwould likely cause harassment, alarm
OL,12,Fand distress, as well as another on
OL,13,Fsuspicion of an immigration offence.
