PN,31908
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786448897
OL,3,CFerrari worth #3.7m among cars seized
OL,4,Cin London police crackdown
OL,6,FPolice said the number and value of
OL,7,Fthe vehicles seized was the highest in
OL,8,Fthe five years of the operation.
OL,10,FAngus Eaton, CEO of the Motor
OL,11,FInsurers' Bureau, said: "Operations
OL,12,Flike these show that the rules apply
OL,13,Fto all motorists, regardless of the
OL,14,Fvalue of the vehicle they chose to
OL,15,Fdrive.
OL,17,F"We know that while many offenders
OL,18,Fknowingly violate the law, others that
OL,19,Faim to be law-abiding motorists may be
OL,20,Fcaught out by making a genuine
OL,21,Finsurance mistake.
OL,26,@sD@YOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31909
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786448897
OL,3,CFerrari worth #3.7m among cars seized
OL,4,Cin London police crackdown
OL,6,F"We want to help all motorists
OL,7,Funderstand the importance of having
OL,8,Fthe right insurance because the
OL,9,Fconsequences of not having insurance
OL,10,For getting the right cover for their
OL,11,Fneeds are severe and long-lasting.
OL,13,F"We urge all motorists to check they
OL,14,Fhave cover in place and that it's
OL,15,Fadequate for them, their vehicle, and
OL,16,Ftheir journey types."
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@AOUxD@UO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/12
