OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31910
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786448897
OL,3,CFerrari worth #3.7m among cars seized
OL,4,Cin London police crackdown
OL,6,FThe Met's operation featured 120
OL,7,Fofficers, including 95 from the Met's
OL,8,FSpecial Constabulary and Vehicle
OL,9,FEnforcement Team, backed by Motor
OL,10,FInsurers' Bureau's expertise in
OL,11,Funinsured driving prevention and
OL,12,Fadvanced roadside support.
OL,14,FEvery week someone in the UK is killed
OL,15,Fby an uninsured driver, with daily
OL,16,Fcases of life-altering injuries.
OL,18,FOffences often involve wider criminal
OL,19,Factivity, including drug offences,
OL,20,Fdrink-driving and illegal street-
OL,21,Fracing, a spokesman said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
