SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786448897
OL,3,CFerrari worth #3.7m among cars seized
OL,4,Cin London police crackdown
OL,6,FCouncillor Caroline Sargent,
OL,7,FWestminster City Council's deputy
OL,8,Fleader and cabinet member for
OL,9,Fenforcement, said: "People who think
OL,10,Fit's acceptable to drive illegally in
OL,11,FWestminster are not welcome here.
OL,13,F"The disruption caused by these
OL,14,Freckless drivers and boy racers is
OL,15,Foften worse during the summer months
OL,16,Fand, as well as putting people at
OL,17,Frisk, causes significant nuisance for
OL,18,Fresidents and businesses."
OL,26,@qD@TOUuD@AOUzD@ZO]
